      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": [
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "ABSTRACT",
          "content": "Sequential and iterative Pd-catalyzed cross-coupling reactions can be performed in which the order of C-C bond formations can be controlled either by the attenuated leaving groups of the multireactive substrate or by specific catalyst/ligand combinations. This tutorial review gives an overview about recent developments in this field and the various strategies used for the assembly of oligoarenes and -alkenes."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "GRAPHICAL ABSTRACT"
        }
